				<r3d:description language="eng">&lt;&lt;&lt;!!!&lt;&lt;&lt; As of 2017-05-17 the data catalog is no longer available &gt;&gt;&gt;!!!&gt;&gt;&gt;
 DataFed is a web services-based software that non-intrusively mediates between autonomous, distributed data providers and users. The main goals of DataFed are: Aid air quality management and science by effective use of relevant data - Facilitate the access and flow of atmospheric data from provider to users - Support the development of user-driven data processing value chains. DataFed Catalog links searchable Datafed applications worldwide.</r3d:description>
